WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.640
Es hora de decir adiós.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.760
What do you mean goodbye?

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.280
Oh, it's not what it looks like.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.320
No, no, no.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.120
It's exactly what it looks like.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.600
By the way, did you know that

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.800
lieutenant Columbo was

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.920
my favorite character of all time?

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.920
One more thing.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.520
You realized you

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.080
couldn't have children

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.840
but instead of admitting that

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.640
you started blaming Gina, right?

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.360
That's nonsense.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.080
Hey.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.040
Hey, that's still my part.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.480
No, no, no.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.120
Things just didn't

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.920
go as you planned, right?

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.760
Gina was too kind,

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.240
and she left you herself.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.120
She couldn't bear the idea

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.640
of not giving you a child,

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.600
and you decided to tie her

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:07.600
to you another way -

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.200
by keeping her mom

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.520
in a coma, right?

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:12.760
These are just your

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.320
wild accusations.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.600
I extended her mother's life.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.400
Gina had a whole year

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.200
to come to terms

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.720
with her loss.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.800
Until I found someone

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.360
to buy her organs.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.840
Where is my patient?
